---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, "/");
---

<nav class="or not-content" aria-label="On this page">
  <p class="or-about">A course in how a trustworthy data pipeline fits together, built around Touchline, a working platform that collects results from about a thousand college soccer websites.</p>
  <p class="or-meta"><span>10 modules</span><span>Self-paced</span><span>Labs optional, a browser is enough</span><span>No soccer or pipeline background needed</span></p>
  <ol>
    <li><a href="#film"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg>Watch the film <span>2 min</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="#one-match"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="5" cy="12" r="2"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/><circle cx="19" cy="12" r="2"/><path d="M7 12h3M14 12h3"/></svg>See the seven steps</a></li>
    <li><a href="#the-journey"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 4 3 6v14l6-2 6 2 6-2V4l-6 2-6-2z"/><path d="M9 4v14M15 6v14"/></svg>The ten modules</a></li>
    <li><a class="or-go" href={`${base}modules/01-collection/`}>Start Module 1<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></li>
  </ol>
</nav>

<style is:global>
  .or { max-width: 52rem; margin: 0 auto 1rem; color: var(--tl-muted); font-size: 0.92rem; }
  .or p { margin: 0 0 0.45rem; }
  .or .or-about { max-width: 44rem; color: var(--tl-ink); font-size: 1rem; }
  .or .or-meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .or-meta span + span::before { content: "·"; margin: 0 0.5rem; }
  .or ol { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .or li { margin: 0; }
  .or a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; min-height: 50px; padding: 0.55rem 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--tl-line); border-radius: 6px; background: var(--tl-card); color: var(--tl-ink); font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 650; text-decoration: none; }
  .or a svg { width: 1.15rem; height: 1.15rem; fill: none; stroke: var(--sl-color-accent); stroke-width: 2; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .or a:hover { border-color: var(--sl-color-accent); }
  .or a span { color: var(--tl-muted); font-weight: 400; }
  .or a.or-go { border-color: var(--sl-color-accent); background: var(--sl-color-accent); color: var(--sl-color-black); font-weight: 750; }
  :root[data-theme="light"] .or a.or-go { color: #fff; }
  .or a.or-go svg { stroke: currentColor; }
  .or a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--sl-color-white); outline-offset: 2px; }
</style>
